用的表面，而需要",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":["回到网络通信的第一性原理：TCP 连接的使用方式、数据编码格式以及协议层面的抽象。",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"绝大多数现代网络通信（除了 HTTP/3 基于 UDP）都建立在 TCP 之上。这五种技术的本质区别，实际上是"}],"如何利用 TCP 连接"]}],"以及",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"如何定义数据交换的格式"}],"。"]}],"\n",["$","h2","h2-0",{"id":"1-协议速览","children":["$","a","a-0",{"href":"#1-协议速览","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"#1-协议速览"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"1. 协议速览","position":{"start":{"line":9,"column":4,"offset":409},"end":{"line":9,"column":11,"offset":416}}}]},"children":"1. 协议速览"}]}],"\n",["$","h3","h3-0",{"id":"http11","children":["$","a","a-0",{"href":"#http11","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"#http11"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"HTTP/1.1","position":{"start":{"line":11,"column":5,"offset":422},"end":{"line":11,"column":13,"offset":430}}}]},"children":"HTTP/1.1"}]}],"\n",["$","p","p-3",{"children":"这是互联网的基石。在最原始的模型中，它遵循一次请求，一次连接的模式（虽然 Keep-Alive 改善了复用，但逻辑上仍是独立的）。"}],"\n",["$","ul","ul-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"底层原理："}]," 客户端发起 TCP 握手 -> 发送 HTTP Header + Body -> 服务器处理 -> 返回 HTTP Header + Body -> (可能) 关闭连接。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"通信模式："}]," 严格的半双工（Half-duplex）逻辑。客户端不问，服务器不说。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"数据格式："}]," 通常是 JSON (文本) 或 XML。可读性好，但序列化/反序列化有性能损耗。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-3",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"缺点："}]," 头部冗余（Header overhead）大。如果要实时获取数据，必须使用",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"轮询 (Polling)"}],"，这会制造大量的无效请求，浪费服务器资源和带宽。"]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","blockquote","blockquote-0",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":["关于 HTTP 更多细节可参阅：",["$","a","a-0",{"href":"https://hedon.top/2025/11/29/computer-net/net-http/","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"https://hedon.top/2025/11/29/computer-net/net-http/"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"从 HTTP1.0 到 HTTP3 的演化","position":{"start":{"line":20,"column":20,"offset":805},"end":{"line":20,"column":41,"offset":826}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":20,"column":19,"offset":804},"end":{"line":20,"column":95,"offset":880}}},"target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","children":"从 HTTP1.0 到 HTTP3 的演化"}]]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","h3","h3-1",{"id":"streamable-http","children":["$","a","a-0",{"href":"#streamable-http","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"#streamable-http"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Streamable HTTP","position":{"start":{"line":24,"column":5,"offset":888},"end":{"line":24,"column":20,"offset":903}}}]},"children":"Streamable HTTP"}]}],"\n","$L8","\n","$L9","\n","$La","\n","$Lb","\n","$Lc","\n","$Ld","\n","$Le","\n","$Lf","\n","$L10","\n","$L11","\n","$L12","\n","$L13","\n","$L14","\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n","$L15","\n","$L16","\n","$L17","\n","$L18","\n","$L19","\n","$L1a","\n","$L1b","\n","$L1c","\n","$L1d","\n","$L1e","\n","$L1f","\n","$L20","\n","$L21","\n","$L22","\n","$L23","\n","$L24","\n","$L25","\n","$L26"]}]}],"$L27","$L28","$L29"]}],"$L2a"]}]]}]}]
