12:["$","p","p-7",{"children":["gRPC 是 Google 开发的高性能框架。它和前面几个不在一个维度：WebSocket 是一种协议，而 gRPC 是一个框架，它默认基于 ",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"HTTP/2"}]," 协议。"]}]
13:["$","ul","ul-4",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"底层原理："}],"\n",["$","ol","ol-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"HTTP/2 多路复用："}]," 也就是在一个 TCP 连接上并发处理多个请求，解决了 HTTP/1.1 的队头阻塞问题。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Protobuf (Protocol Buffers)："}]," 放弃 JSON，使用二进制序列化。数据极其紧凑，且需要预先定义 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":".proto"}]," 文件（Schema）。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"RPC (远程过程调用)："}]," 对开发者屏蔽了网络细节。你调用远程服务器的 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"GetUser()"}]," 方法，就像调用本地函数一样。"]}],"\n"]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"gRPC 支持四种模式："}],"\n",["$","ol","ol-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":"简单 RPC（类似标准 HTTP）。"}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":"服务端流式（类似 SSE）。"}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":"客户端流式。"}],"\n",["$","li","li-3",{"children":"双向流式（类似 WebSocket）。"}],"\n"]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"缺点："}]," 浏览器支持较差（需要 gRPC-Web 代理），调试不如 JSON 直观（是乱码的二进制）。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-3",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"适用场景："}]," 微服务内部通信（高频、低延迟）、IoT 设备通信、多语言混合开发环境。"]}],"\n"]}]
