1e:["$","ul","ul-6",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"SSE 的长连接诅咒："}]," 旧版 MCP 要求 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"/sse"}]," 连接必须",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"一直活着"}],"。\n",["$","ul","ul-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"现实世界："}]," 企业的防火墙、Nginx 负载均衡器、云服务网关（AWS ALB, Cloudflare）非常讨厌占着茅坑不拉屎的空闲长连接。它们会强行切断这些连接（Timeout）。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"后果："}]," 客户端必须不断写复杂的保活（Keep-alive）和重连逻辑。"]}],"\n"]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Streamable HTTP 的优势："}]," 它是**按需（On-Demand）**的。\n",["$","ul","ul-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":"有任务？发个 POST，保持连接直到任务结束。"}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":"没任务？连接自然关闭。"}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":"这完全符合 HTTP 的设计初衷，对所有的中间件（Middleware）都非常友好。"}],"\n"]}],"\n"]}],"\n"]}]
